      "en": "So Joshua made a covenant with the people that day, and made for them a statute and an ordinance in Shechem.",
      "ko": "그 날에 여호수아가 세겜에서 백성으로 더불어 언약을 세우고 그들을 위하여 율례와 법도를 베풀었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "3134ded4567d99bf4816f69261e3fe35fc3b66598a9f9b755fbc01a5933569b0",
      "translation_text_hash": "df51fbed89c7e4ebe6b1ba74f7f0d5edbaae4d4a45ba2f2ed9f0e83f6eb324b5",
